\"address\":\"\",\"createBy\":\"1\",\"inx\":1,\"deleted\":0,\"relateDetailIds\":[],\"createTime\":1781083830000,\"videoCover\":\"\",\"remarks\":\"\"}','{\"code\":200,\"data\":1,\"msg\":\"succeed\",\"success\":true,\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-10 17:42:48\"}',0,NULL,'2026-06-10 17:42:48'),(1432,'修改景点',2,'com.pz.travel.controller.TravelBackstageController.update()','PUT',1,'admin',NULL,'/travel/backstage/update','192.168.1.115','内网IP','{\"backgroundCover\":\"https://ar-travel-file.1jiaohu.com/resource/20260610/afad066c80e64c3f9c2d46829a2371b2.jpg\",\"audioUrl\":\"\",\"id\":819732931194130432,\"englishIntroduction\":\"\",\"likes\":0,\"longitude\":\"37.423038,112.583703\",\"pictureUrl\":\"https://ar-travel-file.1jiaohu.com/resource/20260610/26f5dfb05136413abfed90bb496d65cc.jpg\",\"activityName\":\"\",\"activityUrl\":\"\",\"isVr\":0,\"name\":\"草坪音乐节\",\"isUser\":0,\"status\":1,\"englishName\":\"草坪音乐节\",\"activity\":0,\"travelJointList\":[],\"content\":\"<p>校各单位：</p><p>根据《中共山西省委宣传部山西省科学技术协会山西省科学技术厅关于开展2026年“山西最美科技工作者”学习宣传活动的通知》（附件）要求，我校开展2026年山西省“最美科技工作者”推荐工作，有关事项安排如下：</p><p>1、各单位根据文件要求自愿组织推荐，择优推荐不超过1名科技工作者参加遴选。</p><p>2、本次推荐面向基层。突出基层一线，注重选树青年科技工作者（45岁以下）典型，兼顾不同类别、年龄、性别的科技工作者（党外科技人员优先）。</p><p>3、工作单位：山西农业大学；推荐单位：山西省农学会；纪检意见由科研部统一办理。</p><p>4、各单位于7月10日前将候选人推荐表和汇总表Word版、盖章版汇总表发送至邮箱<a href=\\\"mailto:sxndxsjl@126.com\\\">sxndxsjl@126.com</a>。</p><p>联系人：王慧贤 李琦</p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\\\"https://ar-travel-file.1jiaohu.com/resource/20260610/ae98ee4950b140ae9c6e65f40fed30c5.jpg\\\" style=\\\"max-width:100%;\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-extentions-extra-ocr-id=\\\"b993da0ce4651f062bf40a4fcd1a9f68\\\"/></p>\",\"pageviews\":0,\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"moduleId\":923342,\"address\":\"\",\"createBy\":\"1\",\"inx\":1,\"deleted\":0,\"relateDetailIds\":[],\"createTime\":1781083830000,\"videoCover\":\"\",\"remarks\":\"\"}','{\"code\":200,\"data\":1,\"msg\":\"succeed\",\"success\":true,\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-10 18:00:47\"}',0,NULL,'2026-06-10 18:00:46'),(1433,'新增景点',1,'com.pz.travel.controller.TravelBackstageController.add()','POST',1,'admin',NULL,'/travel/backstage/add','192.168.1.115','内网IP','{\"backgroundCover\":\"https://ar-travel-file.1jiaohu.com/resource/20260610/05d042b6fe1a4180ab8121e6d5cc7ed9.jpg\",\"audioUrl\":\"\",\"id\":819740936698597376,\"travelModelVideos\":[],\"englishIntroduction\":\"\",\"longitude\":\"37.423038,112.583703\",\"pictureUrl\":\"https://ar-travel-file.1jiaohu.com/resource/20260610/ea5461f9f66f4d43a1e6230e63fb26ab.jpg\",\"isVr\":0,\"name\":\"酷跑活动\",\"englishName\":\"酷跑活动\",\"content\":\"<p><img src=\\\"https://ar-travel-file.1jiaohu.com/resource/20260610/774870430c2e45aba1e5e0ea6b431f93.jpg\\\" style=\\\"max-width:100%;\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" data-extentions-extra-ocr-id=\\\"dc49e7c3724b42221477712d554f6e6e\\\"/></p><p><br/></p><p>6月1日至3日，校党委常委、副校（院）长张富强率城乡建设学院党政领导，赴湖北省丹江口市中国南水北调集团江汉水网建设开发有限公司（以下简称集团公司）及相关工程现场，围绕“深化校企合作、拓展就业岗位、搭建产教平台”开展专题调研交流，实地感受南水北调“世纪工程”的建设脉搏，并与企业方在人才培养、技术攻关、学生实习就业等方面达成了多项合作共识。</p>\",\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"moduleId\":923342,\"createBy\":\"1\",\"inx\":2,\"relateDetailIds\":[],\"createTime\":1781085738247,\"videoCover\":\"\"}','{\"code\":200,\"data\":1,\"msg\":\"succeed\",\"success\":true,\"timestamp\":\"2026-06-10 18:02:18\"}',0,NULL,'2026-06-10 18:02:18'),(1434,'菜单管理',2,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysMenuController.edit()','PUT',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/menu','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"visible\":\"1\",\"icon\":\"checkbox\",\"orderNum\":\"0\",\"menuName\":\"首页\",\"params\":{},\"parentId\":0,\"isCache\":\"0\",\"path\":\"/\",\"component\":\"index\",\"children\":[],\"createTime\":1646300954000,\"updateBy\":\"admin\",\"isFrame\":\"1\",\"menuId\":2017,\"menuType\":\"C\",\"perms\":\"\",\"status\":\"0\"}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2026-06-18 10:13:28'),(1435,'菜单管理',3,'com.ruoyi.web.controller.system.SysMenuController.remove()','DELETE',1,'admin',NULL,'/system/menu/2038','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{menuId=2038}','{\"msg\":\"操作成功\",\"code\":200}',0,NULL,'2026-06-18 10:32:08'),(1436,'删除栏目',5,'c