2367410-5358-4a89-96e4-b9c513bcfdd9%E9%9F%A9%E6%B0%8F%E6%A5%BC%20(3).png\\\" data-extentions-extra-ocr-id=\\\"f12929b7b49e9a85970a153a2da785db\\\"/></p>\",\"pageviews\":0,\"videoUrl\":\"\",\"moduleId\":847162,\"address\":\"\",\"ticket\":\"免费\",\"createBy\":\"1\",\"inx\":1,\"deleted\":0,\"relateDetailIds\":[],\"createTime\":1781082080000,\"videoCover\":\"\",\"remarks\":\"山西农业大学\"}','{\"code\":200,\"data\":1,\"msg\":\"succeed\",\"success\":true,\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-22 17:36:07\"}',0,NULL,'2026-09-22 17:36:07'),(1629,'修改景点',2,'com.pz.travel.controller.TravelBackstageController.update()','PUT',1,'admin',NULL,'/travel/backstage/update','127.0.0.1','内网IP','{\"backgroundCover\":\"https://ar-travel-file.1jiaohu.com/resource/20260610/b36bd62ed70340ae9a9acdb9df1294ec.jpg\",\"audioUrl\":\"https://content-vintage-includes-night.trycloudflare.com/img/mingxian_audio.wav\",\"id\":819723818527625216,\"travelModelVideos\":[],\"englishIntroduction\":\"<p><br></p>\",\"likes\":0,\"longitude\":\"37.425856,112.582578\",\"pictureUrl\":\"https://ar-travel-file.1jiaohu.com/resource/20260610/d18d6024be6749f18fa5208b5cff939c.jpg\",\"activityName\":\"\",\"activityUrl\":\"\",\"isVr\":0,\"name\":\"山西铭贤学校旧址\",\"isUser\":0,\"status\":1,\"englishName\":\"Oberlin Shansi Memorial School Old Site\",\"activity\":0,\"travelJointList\":[{\"scenicId\":819723818527625216,\"id\":1299829498950455296,\"classificationId\":\"301883092531154944\"}],\"content\":\"<p style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\"><img src=\\\"https://ar-travel.1jiaohu.com/files/20250929/a998eb72-782c-4a5b-a575-fa61ceb1fbe5ccc33bdf0cd84f5080726134406e0f3c.gif\\\" width=\\\"30%\\\"/><br/><br/></p><p style=\\\"text-align:center;\\\">山西铭贤学校旧址</p><p><img src=\\\"https://ar-travel.1jiaohu.com/files/20250929/d4156e0b-fbf8-4baa-8947-58c0270a4f94%E5%B1%B1%E8%A5%BF%E9%93%AD%E8%B4%A4%E5%AD%A6%E6%A0%A1.jpg\\\" data-extentions-extra-ocr-id=\\\"43d531f5c14e129461062a844ac2d031\\\" width=\\\"100%\\\"/></p><p>清<a href=\\\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%A3%E7%BB%9F/1523933?fromModule=lemma_inlink\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">宣统</a>元年（1909年），孔祥熙将创办的铭贤学校搬迁至山西铭贤学校旧址，随学校的发展扩大，校舍陆续增建形成现有规模。民国二十一年（1932年）学校南迁，更名为铭贤学院。</p><p>1950年，铭贤学院迁回山西铭贤学校旧址。</p><p>1951年，山西铭贤学校被政府接收，更名为山西农学院。</p><p>1979年，山西农学院更名为山西农业大学。</p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\\\"https://ar-travel.1jiaohu.com/files/20250929/a55f6333-5c3e-4d6b-be3f-37f4b74a3e5ewps.png\\\" data-extentions-extra-ocr-id=\\\"bc57d408d846962bb47a5a2f1eea350d\\\"/>《亮剑》中南京军事学院一太谷<a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https://ent.163.com/keywords/5/7/5c71897f/1.html\\\">山西</a>农业大学</p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\\\"https://ar-travel.1jiaohu.com/files/20250929/5578d578-b145-4512-8ac2-399e53a5eb43wps%20(1).png\\\" data-extentions-extra-ocr-id=\\\"4e31cc9a68c6daeaf6aca8b50b87e48a\\\"/>《亮剑》中南京军事学院一太谷山西农业大学</p><p><','{\"code\":200,\"data\":1,\"msg\":\"succeed\",\"success\":true,\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-22 17:39:27\"}',0,NULL,'2026-09-22 17:39:27');
